        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PW400, 4\" Wire Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple cabinet pull has a 4-5/16 inch overall length. The contemporary design, with its simplicity, makes it easy to maintain and keep clean. It is great for businesses where sanitation is important like the offices of dentists and doctors. The solid brass 4 Inch C Pull is great for cabinets, drawers, bathroom vanities, or small utility type doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation. \r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PW400-size.gif?v=1704354768\" width=\"451\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PW400 Wire Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other sizes: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-inch-cabinet-pull-deltana-pw300\"><b>3\" Wire Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-1-2-inch-c-pull-deltana-pw350\"><b>3-1/2\" Wire Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PW400 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PW400.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PW400 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch C Cabinet Pull | Deltana PW400",
                "description": "4 Inch C Cabinet Pull Deltana PW400 - This simple cabinet pull has a 4-5/16 inch overall length. The contemporary design, with its simplicity, makes it easy to maintain and keep clean. It is great for businesses where sanitation is important like the offices of dentists and doctors. The solid brass 4 Inch C Pull is great for cabinets, drawers, bathroom vanities, or small utility type doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation. Available in 9 finishes.",
